# `.gitignore` rules are NOT honoured by the Vercel CLI — only this file is. Without it the
# KRACHT deploy (which uploads from the repo ROOT so the symlinked photos in
# apps/shop-kracht/public resolve) would also ship the built output of the other two projects,
# the Playwright artifacts and the benchmark gallery. None of it is used by `next build`.
dist/
test-results/
playwright-report/
bench/
e2e/
